# hypernix.hyped_pro_gui API reference

Implementation: `src/hypernix/interfaces/hyped_pro_gui.py`

## `choose_qt_platform(session) -> str | None`

Return a QT_QPA_PLATFORM value to try first, or None to let Qt decide.

## `try_launch_qt() -> bool`

Attempt to launch the Qt6 GUI. Returns False if Qt6 isn't usable at
